      "content": "but there is no \"before.\" the person i was was defined by that research. without it, i'm just a person who failed. it feels like i've wasted all these years being a tool for a purpose that doesn't even exist anymore. how am i supposed to just \"reach out\" and pretend i'm still someone people actually care about? everything feels so hollow.",
